      <item>session_report_refresh</item>
      <item>release_candidate_check</item>
      <item>release_ops_gate</item>
    </required_entrypoints>
    <notes>
      <item>Blocked retry_failed caution and not_ready outcomes stay in coverage evidence when explicitly supplied to release_candidate_check.</item>
      <item>Candidate subset remains narrow so release gate reflects readiness of designated promotion tasks.</item>
      <item>Profile is source-of-truth for batch11 release ops defaults unless explicit CLI overrides are provided.</item>
    </notes>
